Read file "guests.csv" and call it guests.
Let coming be guests who say yes.
Show how many guests there are in coming.
Let total be 0.
For each guest in coming:
    add 1 to total
    add guest plus ones to total
Show total.
For each guest in coming:
    count meal of guest with plus ones
Show meals.
Make a pie chart of meals called "meals.svg".
